# Repo-root ignores for the Flutter app, which lives here. Based on Flutter's
# own template; the platform folders keep their generated .gitignore files.
#
# Be careful adding anything that could match `lib/`: the Dart source is at
# lib/, and an ignore rule covering it fails silently: already-tracked files
# stay tracked, and only NEW files vanish from `git status`.
# `git check-ignore -v lib/main.dart` must print nothing.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored, unlike some Flutter templates:
# - *.lock: pubspec.lock is committed so application builds are reproducible.
# - The generated plugin registrants of Linux, Windows and macOS, tracked as in
#   Flutter's app template.
# - .python-version: commit it if one is ever added.

# ---- Flutter / Dart / pub ----
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
.pub-preload-cache/
.fvm/
**/doc/api/
coverage/
.coverage
flutter_*.png
linked_*.ds
unlinked.ds
unlinked_spec.ds
app.*.symbols
app.*.map.json
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
**/.build/
.swiftpm/
migrate_working_dir/

# ---- Signing secrets and store outputs: NEVER commit (see .github/RELEASING.md) ----
android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
**/*.p8
*.mobileprovision
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
**/fastlane/report.xml
**/fastlane/Preview.html
**/fastlane/screenshots
**/fastlane/test_output
# Windows code-signing. `dart run msix:create` generates a self-signed test
# certificate next to the project when none is configured; it is a private key
# like any other. No CA certificate is ever needed here; the Microsoft Store
# re-signs MSIX packages itself.
*.pfx
*.cer
*.p12

# ---- Local secrets ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---- Docs (Sphinx, built by Read the Docs from docs/) and Python tooling ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
docs/_build/
# Rendered from schema/tsv_schema.json by docs/_ext/generated_includes.py on
# every build.
docs/_generated/
.venv/
venv/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/
poster-openscienceday/

# ---- Coding agents' private files (AGENTS.md is the shared one) ----
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
.aider*

# ---- Editors ----
.vscode/
.classpath
.project
.settings/
.ccls-cache
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/
.atom/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
*.swp
*.class
*.log

# ---- OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
